    "detailed_description": "<u><strong>Fantasy Otome Visual Novel</strong></u><br><br>inspired by<br>\u300ePeter Pan, or The Boy Who Wouldn't Grow Up(1904)\u300f<br>\u300ePeter and Wendy(1911)\u300f<br>by J. M. Barrie<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894840/extras/ed6adb85f46fa3b763d2d12d36113af0.avif?t=1740390947\" width=500 height=500 /></span><br><br>\u201cWow, seriously? You're the No.1 worst skyfarer I've ever met!\u201d<br><br>A mischievous boy who does whatever he wants.<br>He doesn\u2019t listen to anyone, especially not you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894840/extras/64fd319875381f9fe513f8be407ae74c.avif?t=1740390947\" width=500 height=500 /></span><br><br>\u201cNow, decide. Become a pirate, or live as a prisoner.\u201d  <br><br>The captain of the pirate ship Dreadnought.<br>The pirates serve him, but they do so in fear.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894840/extras/b46ba25e895decf19681825747707b86.avif?t=1740390947\" width=500 height=500 /></span><br><br>\u201cHello, intruders! If you don\u2019t want to stay crying in this pit, be nice!\u201d<br><br>After meeting you, he realizes<br>that some people can\u2019t even tell which mushrooms are safe to eat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894840/extras/44c22ef02ecb1e8336ce458ccbcdd314.avif?t=1740390947\" width=500 height=500 /></span><br> <br>\u201cNever mind. You wouldn\u2019t remember anyway.\u201d<br><br>The fairy of the Rose Gate. Every time you meet him, he\u2019s different.<br>Which side of him is real?<br> <br><u><strong>In Development</strong></u><br><br>4+ Romanceable Characters<br>10+ Hours of Gameplay<br>Voice Acting (Japanese)<br>Beautiful Art<br>Original Soundtrack <br><br><u><strong>Coming Soon</strong></u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894840/extras/c62a55f7e441f4004f5a5d80b4d3a611.avif?t=1740390947\" width=500 height=546 /></span><br><br><i><u>Hey, have you ever heard of Neverland?</u></i><br><br>She was the first-born in her family. A mature and independent girl.<br>A kind, reliable sister,<br>And a well-mannered, exemplary student.<br>She was old enough not to be coaxed into believing in a world just for children.<br><br><i><u>You could be a kid forever!</u></i><br><br>The same old routine began to gain colors<br>When a boy crash-landed by the fireplace.<br><br>The land of fantasies and adventures.<br>The land of pirates and treasures.<br>The land of fairies and mysteries.<br><br><i><u>Look at you. You know how to fly. You know how to be free.</u></i>",
    "about_the_game": "<u><strong>Fantasy Otome Visual Novel</strong></u><br><br>inspired by<br>\u300ePeter Pan, or The Boy Who Wouldn't Grow Up(1904)\u300f<br>\u300ePeter and Wendy(1911)\u300f<br>by J. M. Barrie<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894840/extras/ed6adb85f46fa3b763d2d12d36113af0.avif?t=1740390947\" width=500 height=500 /></span><br><br>\u201cWow, seriously? You're the No.1 worst skyfarer I've ever met!\u201d<br><br>A mischievous boy who does whatever he wants.<br>He doesn\u2019t listen to anyone, especially not you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894840/extras/64fd319875381f9fe513f8be407ae74c.avif?t=1740390947\" width=500 height=500 /></span><br><br>\u201cNow, decide. Become a pirate, or live as a prisoner.\u201d  <br><br>The captain of the pirate ship Dreadnought.<br>The pirates serve him, but they do so in fear.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894840/extras/b46ba25e895decf19681825747707b86.avif?t=1740390947\" width=500 height=500 /></span><br><br>\u201cHello, intruders! If you don\u2019t want to stay crying in this pit, be nice!\u201d<br><br>After meeting you, he realizes<br>that some people can\u2019t even tell which mushrooms are safe to eat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894840/extras/44c22ef02ecb1e8336ce458ccbcdd314.avif?t=1740390947\" width=500 height=500 /></span><br> <br>\u201cNever mind. You wouldn\u2019t remember anyway.\u201d<br><br>The fairy of the Rose Gate. Every time you meet him, he\u2019s different.<br>Which side of him is real?<br> <br><u><strong>In Development</strong></u><br><br>4+ Romanceable Characters<br>10+ Hours of Gameplay<br>Voice Acting (Japanese)<br>Beautiful Art<br>Original Soundtrack <br><br><u><strong>Coming Soon</strong></u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894840/extras/c62a55f7e441f4004f5a5d80b4d3a611.avif?t=1740390947\" width=500 height=546 /></span><br><br><i><u>Hey, have you ever heard of Neverland?</u></i><br><br>She was the first-born in her family. A mature and independent girl.<br>A kind, reliable sister,<br>And a well-mannered, exemplary student.<br>She was old enough not to be coaxed into believing in a world just for children.<br><br><i><u>You could be a kid forever!</u></i><br><br>The same old routine began to gain colors<br>When a boy crash-landed by the fireplace.<br><br>The land of fantasies and adventures.<br>The land of pirates and treasures.<br>The land of fairies and mysteries.<br><br><i><u>Look at you. You know how to fly. You know how to be free.</u></i>",
